---
import { ArrowUpRight } from '@lucide/astro'
import { site } from '../config/site'
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro'
---
<section class="section lab-section" id="lab" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-topline"><SectionHeading label="THE LAB" title="One Human. AI in the Loop." id="lab-title" /><span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">02 / 03</span></div>
    <div class="lab-grid">
      <div class="body-copy lab-copy">
        <h3>An experiment in the future of software engineering.</h3>
        <p>What happens when one experienced business and technology leader uses AI to perform much of the work traditionally undertaken by a software engineering team?</p>
        <p>I'm exploring this question through a practical experiment: developing a financial-services application using AI-enabled analysis, architecture, engineering, testing and deployment.</p>
        <p>The objective is not to prove that AI can replace people.</p>
        <p>It's to understand how AI changes the economics, capabilities and operating models of technology delivery, and where human expertise remains essential.</p>
        <p>I'll document the journey, including the decisions, architecture, tools, experiments, mistakes, costs and lessons learned.</p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href={site.experiment} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow the Experiment <ArrowUpRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-visual">
        <div class="lab-preview" aria-label="Conceptual project preview placeholder">
          <div class="preview-header"><span>THE LAB / EXPERIMENT 01</span><span class="preview-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>
          <div class="preview-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="diagram-orbit orbit-outer"></div><div class="diagram-orbit orbit-inner"></div>
            <div class="diagram-center"><span>HUMAN</span><strong>×</strong><span>AI</span></div>
            <span class="diagram-point point-one"></span><span class="diagram-point point-two"></span><span class="diagram-point point-three"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="preview-footer"><span>ONE HUMAN.</span><span>AI IN THE LOOP.</span></div>
        </div>
        <blockquote>If one person can build something substantial with AI, what could an organisation achieve by fundamentally rethinking how its teams work?</blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
